<section class="mx-auto max-w-xl mt-10">
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Idobata Vision</h3>

  <h4 class="text-xl mt-6">Team Mirai's "Mirai Idobata Kaigi"</h4>
  <p class="mt-4">
    "Mirai Idobata Kaigi", run by Team Mirai, uses Idobata Vision to collect citizens' opinions and organize the issues with AI.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a
      href="https://kaigi.team-mir.ai/top"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="btn btn-outline h-9"
      hreflang="ja"
    >
      Visit Mirai Idobata Kaigi (Japanese) →
    </a>
  </div>

  <h5 class="text-lg mt-6">What users said (translated from Japanese)</h5>
  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
    <div class="border rounded p-4">
      <a
        href="https://x.com/kazuneiwasa/status/1924801224198783367"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
      >
        @kazuneiwasa:
        When you chat with the "Mirai Idobata Kaigi" system, it pulls together participants' comments and lists 93 issues and 96 solutions…
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="border rounded p-4">
      <a
        href="https://x.com/kazuneiwasa/status/1924802106164429304"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
      >
        @kazuneiwasa:
        The AI has already organized the issues, and six key points and a summary were generated in an instant…
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="border rounded p-4">
      <a
        href="https://x.com/nishio/status/1923636525365068238"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
      >
        @nishio:
        The AI moderator of Mirai Idobata Kaigi is excellent. It listened to everyone talking freely and came out with this summary. Far too good.
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h4 class="text-xl mt-8">Constitutional Democratic Party of Japan</h4>
  <p class="mt-4">
    The Constitutional Democratic Party of Japan has also announced that it will use Idobata Vision, with operation planned to start.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a
      href="https://cdp-japan.jp/news/20250422_9145"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="btn btn-outline h-9"
      hreflang="ja"
    >
      See the announcement (Japanese) →
    </a>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Idobata Policy</h3>

  <h4 class="text-xl mt-6">Team Mirai's manifesto</h4>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Team Mirai uses Idobata Policy to draft and improve its policy platform, making a policymaking process that reflects citizens' opinions.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a
      href="https://policy.team-mir.ai/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="btn btn-outline h-9"
      hreflang="ja"
    >
      See the policy platform (Japanese) →
    </a>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Refining policy proposals with Team Mirai</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Idobata's policymaking tool is used to invite proposed changes to the policy platform from the public.
    See <a
      href="https://policy.team-mir.ai/view/"
      class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
      hreflang="ja"
    >here</a> for details (Japanese).
  </p>
</section>
